                                                "text": "And in (123) below, a (bracketed) Adverbial Phrase has undergone WH MOVEMENT:\n (123) (a) [How quickly] will he drink the beer —?\n (123) (b) [How carefully] did he plan his campaign —?\n (123) (c) [How well] did he treat her —?"
                                            }
